    "summary": "Task 14 adds no code of its own. Both suites were run, the daemon was pushed, updated and restarted before the plugin was installed (push on the user's word), and the user checked the pane by hand. Three fixes found in the hand check were committed under this Story: the review client names the workspace folder as repo on every call; no comment button is offered while no document is open; a diagram or mock that has its own tab is not also drawn inside the markdown. Two things are stated plainly in the evidence: the chat-timing check (a decision sent while a turn runs, and one with the chat closed) was not tried by hand, and the entity-model diagram's tab was not separately confirmed.",
